  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Leadership and Influencing - Political Economy Analysis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Political economy analysis of Syria&#x2019;s education sector. Primarily to identify barriers and opportunities for a national education dialogue, to address the fragmentation of the education system, and stimulate progress concerning key issues such as examination and curriculum. To support the primary objective, this political economy analysis will provide up-to-date information on power dynamics in Syria&#x2019;s education sector, considering all areas of control, key players and formal structures.</narrative>
  </description>
